## Initial Q&A
### Did Breitbart News publish a specific article in or around October 2020 alleging that the daughter of Senator Chris Coons appeared on Hunter Biden's laptop?
Answer: No. According to a Lead Stories fact check from October 26, 2020 titled "Fact Check: Breitbart Did NOT Report Daughter Of Sen. Coons And 7 Underaged Girls Were 'Featured' On Hunter Biden's Laptop," Breitbart News did not publish such an article. The claim originated from a Facebook post that misrepresented the source, and PolitiFact also confirmed on the same date that "there is no evidence that a computer hard drive previously belonging to Hunter Biden contains illicit images of Coons' teenage daughter."

